  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild semantics/proofs cleanly and run every positive claim
  ✓ Audit adequacy, real-program pinning, and all local K rules
  ✓ Run a fresh false-mutation non-vacuity test
  → Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
